<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss sight deposits fall to 3,018.3 million Sfr.</title>
<headline>Swiss sight deposits fall to 3,018.3 million Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank said sight deposits fell by 54.7 million Swiss francs to 3,018.3 million in the reporting period ended August 30.  </p>
<p>Statement of August 30 in millions of Swiss francs:</p>
<p>				   Latest   Change   since August 20</p>
<p> Sight deposits		3,018.3   minus   54.7</p>
<p> Currency reserves	   38,619.8  minus   91.3</p>
<p> Domestic securities	 1,281.9   minus   497.8</p>
<p> Notes in circulation	28,236.4  plus    876.3</p>
<p> Other call deposits	 579.0     plus    102.4</p>
<p> Government time deposits  1,675.0   minus   1,325.0</p>
</text>
